`,(0,n.jsxs)(r.p,{children:["A diff is the before-and-after of a change: the lines removed and the lines added, file by file. The ",(0,n.jsx)(r.code,{children:"/diff"})," command opens an interactive viewer of your uncommitted changes in that form, and it can also show what each of Claude's turns changed. Use the up and down arrows to move between files and ",(0,n.jsx)(r.code,{children:"Enter"})," to open one."]}),`
